  (text "U40 senses local driver VM-to-GND; power from the existing host +3V3.\nCT is deliberately open: 12-28 ms recovery qualification. MR follows ACT_DRIVE_EN.\nU41 qualifies motor drive only; the supervisor does not gate U13 startup.\nNominal falling threshold: 0.405 V x (1 + 105k/10k) = 4.6575 V.\nThreshold/delay corners and physical validation are recorded in circuit-review."
